event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `frame-sampling` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling\npython /mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/artifacts --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"ccc1ce24-f90f-4972-a4d0-4dd93f89fa3e"},{"content":"我将严格按照您的要求测试 `frame-sampling` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n首先，读取 SKILL.md 文件：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":125,"prompt_tokens":9031,"total_tokens":9156,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":33,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":125},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9031}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-10b534a6-abf6-9879-8e57-19ca4c9959da","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628e-7269-7621-9854-10d118b9d88c-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 frame-sampling skill 的 SKILL.md 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_39f677a3cf32429faa8a5fd5","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9031,"output_tokens":125,"total_tokens":9156,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":33}}},{"content":"---\nname: frame-sampling\ndescription: Sample structured frames from an existing video file. Use when Codex has video_path, file_path, raw_segment_uri, camera_id, sampling_strategy, capture_seconds, or provided frame records and needs stable Frame schema outputs. This skill exposes OpenCV-backed real video frame extraction.\n---\n\n# Frame Sampling\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a video file instead of `frames`, do not ask the user to provide frames and do not write custom OpenCV extraction code. Call this skill directly with `camera_id`, `video_path`/`file_path`/`raw_segment_uri`, `capture_seconds`, and `sampling_strategy`. Use `sampling_strategy.mode=interval` and `interval_seconds=1` as the default unless the user requests a different cadence.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video <video.mp4> --camera-id <camera_id> --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir <run_dir> --config <config.json> --output <frames.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--video`, `--frames-json`, `--camera-id`, `--capture-seconds`, `--interval-seconds`, `--fps`, `--output-dir`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read camera id, local video path, and sampling strategy.\n2. Support interval, fps, keyframe, and adaptive strategies when available.\n3. Generate stable frame ids from camera id, timestamp, and sequence.\n4. Store sampled images and return Frame schema records.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `camera_id`\n\nCommon fields:\n- `raw_segment_uri`\n- `video_path` or `file_path`\n- `started_at`\n- `capture_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.mode`: `interval` or `fps`\n- `sampling_strategy.interval_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.fps`\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `frames`, each with `frame_id`, `camera_id`, `timestamp`, `image_uri`, `width`, `height`, `sequence`, and for real video `source_elapsed_seconds`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_CAMERA_ID`\n- `VIDEO_OPEN_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run detection, tracking, event recognition, or evidence annotation.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"04c22642-0410-4575-a012-cfb4ab457a09","tool_call_id":"call_39f677a3cf32429faa8a5fd5","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行 bash 命令来运行 frame-sampling skill：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":165,"prompt_tokens":9750,"total_tokens":9915,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":165},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9750}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-314b4811-f5d5-985f-9290-2ce2f5f124b2","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628e-9cbd-7411-a514-b06c9edb6f50-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 frame-sampling skill 的入口脚本","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling\npython /mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/artifacts --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/result.json"},"id":"call_2ca0e0b47e9f4dc1b4ab7ee2","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9750,"output_tokens":165,"total_tokens":9915,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"Command failed: 'ErrorObservation' object has no attribute 'exit_code'","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"24990c51-38ac-4a95-ad28-04587beb92c5","tool_call_id":"call_2ca0e0b47e9f4dc1b4ab7ee2","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"让我尝试直接执行命令，不预先创建目录（脚本可能会自己处理）：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":157,"prompt_tokens":9945,"total_tokens":10102,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":157},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9945}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-0b66a09f-6e7b-9bd8-b689-aaacd740a308","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628e-ac94-7583-8f07-6d494787362d-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 frame-sampling skill 的入口脚本","command":"python /mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/artifacts --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/frame-sampling/result.json"},"id":"call_3cc72523545b4692b568fb3b","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9945,"output_tokens":157,"total_tokens":10102,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"{\n  \"skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n  \"ver